{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-mango-peach-pineapple","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Mango Peach Pineapple","description":"\u003cp\u003eMango Peach Pineapple nic salt e-liquid by Riot Bar Edition sharpens the sweet and fruity flavours of mango and peach with the tangier notes of pineapple, for an exotic vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeaturing a 50% VG concentration, this nic salt will produce a discreet amount of vapour for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale. It pairs best with a refillable kit that's designed for MTL vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41990939443255,"sku":"Riot - Mango Peach Pineapple 20 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41990939476023,"sku":"Riot - Mango Peach Pineapple 48 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/mango-peach-pineapple-nic-salt-e-liquid-by-riot-bar-edition.webp?v=1763425029","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-mango-peach-pineapple","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




